Indent" style="text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="margin-left: 18.0pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Detalle de ajustes por conversión a NCIF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="501" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: 21.3pt; width: 376.0pt"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 20.4pt"&gt;&lt;td style="height: 20.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 175.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;Activo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 20.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 67.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt; NCIF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 20.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 67.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt; PCGA Colombianos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 20.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 67.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: